# Party banter in the Court of the Count and the Rooms of Weeping (docs/regions/castle_ravenloft_court.md). Each node
# opens with an `if` gate; party members speak only through interjections.

~ banter_court_rahadin
if flag.rahadin_met and not flag.rahadin_defeated
interject class:cleric: Every voice around that man is someone he killed. He's carrying a graveyard about with him.
interject tag:blunt: And he still bothered to tell us when supper is.
interject class:wizard: That's what frightens me about him. Not the screaming. The manners.
endif
-> END

~ banter_court_portraits
if visited:court_study and visited:court_kings_hall and flag.ireena_met and name:godrick_pendlebrook and name:thistle
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: That lady's in every room. Over the fire, in the hall, by his bed. Who is she?
interject name:thistle: Looks like Ireena. Lots of pictures of somebody who looks like Ireena. I don't like it.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: No. Neither do I.
endif
-> END

~ banter_court_skull
if flag.argynvost_skull_found and flag.argynvost_skull_known and name:ratatoille and name:godrick_pendlebrook
interject name:ratatoille: A silver dragon, mounted between a bear and a stag like game. It's in the poorest possible taste.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: The knights on the ridge have waited four hundred years for him. He goes home. After we've dealt with the one who hung him there.
endif
-> END

~ banter_court_skull_plain
if flag.argynvost_skull_found and not flag.argynvost_skull_known
interject class:wizard: A silver dragon's skull. Silvers are rare, and they're not hunted for sport. Somebody wanted one dead very badly.
interject tag:blunt: Somebody wanted everybody dead very badly. This whole house is a trophy room.
endif
-> END

~ banter_court_brides
if flag.court_brides_met and not flag.court_brides_fought and name:liriel_dawnsong and name:ratatoille
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: Three women he made into that. I keep thinking of who they were before.
interject name:ratatoille: The quiet one still is, a little. She kept looking at the window. Nobody looks at a window in this house unless they're hoping.
endif
-> END

~ banter_court_gertruda
if guest:gertruda
interject tag:cheerful: We're carrying a sixteen-year-old out of a vampire's castle. My mother would be so proud. Then so angry.
interject guest:gertruda: My mother is going to be angry too. I don't mind. I want her to be.
endif
-> END

~ banter_court_given_back
if flag.gertruda_given_back and name:liriel_dawnsong and name:wren_featherfoot
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: We left that child up there. With him. I won't pretend otherwise.
interject name:wren_featherfoot: Nobody make a joke. Not even me.
endif
-> END

~ banter_court_lief
if flag.lief_freed and name:kip_smudgewick and name:wren_featherfoot
interject name:kip_smudgewick: Forty-one years chained to a desk, and the first thing he did when he was free was tidy it. I understood him completely.
interject name:wren_featherfoot: That's what worries me about you, Kip.
interject name:kip_smudgewick: You saw that desk. It needed doing.
endif
-> END

~ banter_court_anastrasya
if flag.anastrasya_at_rest and name:thistle and name:kip_smudgewick
interject name:thistle: The girl from Krezk. Somebody should tell her ma.
interject name:kip_smudgewick: I'll go, if she has one living. I'll take something with me. You don't go to a mother empty-handed.
endif
-> END

~ banter_court_vault
if flag.court_treasury_found and name:thistle and name:godrick_pendlebrook
interject name:thistle: Big room full of gold, and he never spends any. What's it for? You can't eat gold.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: Maybe he's keeping it for a rainy day.
interject name:thistle: Big. It's always a rainy day here.
interject class:wizard: Dragons hoard because they can't help it. I suspect he hoards because he can't think of anything else to want.
endif
-> END
